<rml>
<head>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="menus.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<div id="menu" class="panel" data-model="menu">
		<div class="title" data-loc="ui.workshop.title">Workbench</div>
		<p class="muted" data-loc="ui.workshop.blurb">The tools are laid out and ready. Crafting arrives
		with a later vertical &mdash; this screen proves the
		FurnitureForm.screen hook (a workstation opens its UI for the
		player).</p>
		<div class="menu-buttons">
			<button data-event-click="menuAction('cancel')" data-loc="ui.workshop.leave">Step away</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
